{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Restore me</b> — Because before he sinned he rejoiced that he had never sinned, therefore the sense is <b>restore me</b>." "And the vav of <b>sustain me</b> is linked with <b>a willing spirit</b>. The sense: sustain me with a willing spirit, to volunteer — as in <b>that I may teach</b>."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 51, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:35.102990809Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}